{"id":"637189","name":"牛肉米粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637189/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱牛肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好酱牛肉(这里我只用了一小块)。","img":"images/637189/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉切成片，待用。","img":"images/637189/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备好干米粉。","img":"images/637189/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧水。","img":"images/637189/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水开后，下入米粉煮熟(大约10分钟左右)。","img":"images/637189/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上锅盖，泡20分钟。","img":"images/637189/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净浮沫，沥干水分备用。","img":"images/637189/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"准备好一个大碗，加入原汤，加少许盐和鸡精。","img":"images/637189/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入米粉。","img":"images/637189/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入一大勺卤牛肉的卤汁。","img":"images/637189/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"摆上酱卤牛肉片。","img":"images/637189/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入香菜。","img":"images/637189/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/637189/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637189/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"超级满足的一碗牛肉粉。","img":"images/637189/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"拌匀，开吃吧！","img":"images/637189/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}